# Talking avatar: portrait + Kokoro TTS -> SkyReels V3 lip-sync MP4 ($avatar).
# Setup: tools\setup_external_venvs.ps1  (.venvs/comfy-wan + models/ weights)
# Dry run without GPU/models: AH_EMULATE_AVATAR=1
#
# Put the motion/scene prompt on the $avatar instruction (not on the wrapper @talk).
# Upstream $llm in the chain consumes prompts[]; see examples/example_image2video.ah.

@portrait: $file('test_data/images/20260524_051036_default_image_1.png')

@line: $llm
Write one short greeting sentence (about 12 words) for a person speaking to camera.
Return only the spoken line, no quotes or stage directions.

@speech: @line -> $text2speech(voice=af_bella)

@avatar_video: $avatar(width=480, height=832, steps=4, fps=24)
Close-up portrait speaking naturally to camera, subtle head movement, friendly expression

@talk: @portrait -> @speech -> @avatar_video

run @talk
